cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these results or the scale metadata, please cite them as below."
title: "Góc Nghiên Cứu: validation of free browser-based statistics tools against R"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Ban biên tập Góc Nghiên Cứu"
    website: "https://gocnghiencuu.com/about/"
    email: "gocnghiencuu1203@gmail.com"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-12"
license: MIT
url: "https://gocnghiencuu.com/en/verification/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/growth547/gocnghiencuu-kiem-chung"
abstract: >-
  Reference values computed with R (psych, lavaan, seminr, EFAtools, stats) on public data sets, and the
  values produced by the free browser-based tools of Góc Nghiên Cứu (gocnghiencuu.com) for Cronbach's alpha,
  exploratory factor analysis, regression, t-test and ANOVA, PLS-SEM, CB-SEM and sample size: 666 values
  compared. Also includes metadata (no item wording) for 121 measurement scales used in Vietnamese theses.
keywords:
  - psychometrics
  - structural equation modeling
  - PLS-SEM
  - Cronbach's alpha
  - factor analysis
  - survey research
  - reproducibility
  - Vietnam
